<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Illinova said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Illinova said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter downgraded Illinova Corp to accumulate from buy, according to a Dean Witter source.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/8 to 26-5/8.</p>
